    "details": "<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Artificial Arcade is a gaming hackathon focused on creativity, innovation, and game development.</li>\n<li>Teams design and develop innovative gaming experiences under time constraints.</li>\n<li>Encourages teamwork, technical skills, and problem-solving.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Domains:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Game Development</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to all students from a technical background.</li>\n<li>Inter-college participation allowed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Team Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Team-based participation only; no individual entries.</li>\n<li>Team size: 2-3 members.</li>\n<li>Inter-college and inter-department teams allowed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Format:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Round 1: Resume Screening</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Teams shortlisted based on resume screening.</li>\n<li>Selected teams advance to Round 2.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Round 2: Offline (24-Hour Hackathon)</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Dates: 23rd&ndash;24th October 2026.</li>\n<li>Teams develop and present their gaming projects.</li>\n<li>Food and refreshments provided.</li>\n<li>Top 10 teams qualify for the Grand Finale.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Round 3: Grand Finale (8 Hours)</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Date: 30th October 2026.</li>\n<li>Top 10 teams compete in the final round.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Regulations:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Valid college ID required for verification.</li>\n<li>Project work must follow the respective round's time limits.</li>\n<li>Plagiarism and unauthorized copying are prohibited.</li>\n<li>Participants must follow the Code of Conduct.</li>\n<li>Judges&rsquo; and organizing committee&rsquo;s decisions are final and binding.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Date &amp; Timeline:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Round 1:</strong> Resume screening before the hackathon.</li>\n<li><strong>Round 2:</strong> 23rd October 2026 &ndash; 24th October 2026 (24 hours).</li>\n<li><strong>Round 3:</strong> 30th October 2026 (8 hours).</li>\n</ul>",
